25:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The healthchecks in the compose file probe a path that isn't served."}]," Both\nservices healthcheck ",["$","code",null,{"children":"http://localhost:PORT/status"}],", but ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/status"}]," only exists\nwhen that server's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"services"}]," block includes ",["$","code",null,{"children":"health"}],". Neither the CAS config\nnor the scheduler's client-facing listener has one. Add ",["$","code",null,{"children":"health: {}"}]," to the\nservices on the port you're probing, or drop the healthcheck."]}]
26:["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-brand/40 bg-brand-soft/40 text-foreground","role":"note","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10Z"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"`--scale` needs a differently shaped compose file"}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"docker compose up -d --scale worker=5"}]," only works against a service literally\nnamed ",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker"}],". The shipped file declares ",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker-1"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker-2"}]," and\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker-3"}]," as three separate services, so scaling it means collapsing them\ninto one service without per-worker volume mounts, at which point each\nreplica needs its paths derived from something unique rather than hardcoded."]}]]}]]}]
